    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Total depreciation and amortization expense was $2.3 billion, $2.5 billion and $2.4 billion for the years ended December 31, 2020, 2019 and 2018, respectively."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
